# Verifies: SPEC §7.4 (no panics) / DECISIONS D-ERR-04 item 7
# Unbounded recursion with no termination condition exhausts the native stack and
# panics (E6008, stack overflow), terminating immediately. There is no safe version;
# the convention is to replace the recursion with iteration such as fold (STDLIB.md §14).

def recurse(n: int): int
    return recurse(n + 1)

result = recurse(0)
